            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The majority noted that while assignor estoppel bars invalidity defenses, the assignor may still argue claim construction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5a65e28396b2a936381123d98771ee5175e298b36196be235eda02d6f7ad895b",
